Z||000011||Cheever2||06-03-2001||06:13 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jefrysuko:<BR>What do you think of my sig?<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>Good contrast of colors between the green grass, blue sky, bright red car & dull red barn; nice balance of filling the frame, with the tree above and the barn in the back;  interesting artistic statement, suggesting the Fiero is an old design yet timeless like the old barn; and above all, the car looks great.  Yep, I'd say that qualifies as a work of art, ready for hanging in the Gugenheim.<P>||||reg||1
